Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:02.78,DCItalic,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}لقد تأخرت
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:06.66,DCItalic,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}مصيبة، ستغضب الآنسة يومي منّي
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:11.71,DCMain,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}أنا آسفة
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.63,DCMain,CHIBA,0,0,0,,{\be1}عجبًا، أنتِ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.38,DCItalic,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}!مستحيل! تشيبا
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.54,DCMain,CHIBA,0,0,0,,{\be1}...أنتِ أيمكن أنّك
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.96,DCMain,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}!!نـ.. نعم
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:21.91,DCMain,CHIBA,0,0,0,,{\be1}...أيمكن أنّك
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.14,DCMain,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}...نعم
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:25.59,DCMain,CHIBA,0,0,0,,{\be1}...هل يعقل أنّك
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:26.55,DCMain,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}نعم؟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.40,DCItalic,NAEKO,0,0,0,,{\be1}اللعنة
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.40,Miike,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\pos(0,0)\c&HFBFBFC&\3c&HFBFCFE&\3a&HFF&\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m 1222 525 l 1223 548 1298 549 1296 526
